        "id": 0,
        "original_id": "9e574f96-301f-56db-b0cc-e9643de5257b",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: The von Trapps, Werner von Trapp, Georg Ritter von Trapp, Agathe Whitehead, Maria von Trapp, Kara Tointon\n- Works: The Sound of Music, The Story of the Trapp Family Singers, The Sound of Music Live (2015)\n- Places: 3 Mills Studios, London\n- Topics: family relationships, adaptations\n\nFacts:\n- Maria von Trapp wrote \"The Story of the Trapp Family Singers,\" which was published in 1949.\n- Werner von Trapp was portrayed as Kurt in \"The Sound of Music.\"\n- The von Trapps are the grandchildren of Werner von Trapp.\n- The von Trapps are the great-grandchildren of Georg Ritter von Trapp and his first wife Agathe Whitehead.\n- The von Trapps are the step-great-grandchildren of Maria von Trapp, who was Georg Ritter von Trapp's second wife.\n- \"The Sound of Music Live (2015)\" was an adaptation of Rodgers and Hammerstein's Broadway musical \"The Sound of Music.\"\n- Kara Tointon starred as Maria von Trapp in \"The Sound of Music Live (2015).\"\n- \"The Sound of Music Live (2015)\" was performed and televised live from 3 Mills Studios in London.",
